# =============================================================================
# AfriOS root .gitignore
#
# (Previous content of this file was an auto-generated placeholder describing
# an empty .gitignore. It carried no actual ignore rules and has been replaced
# with the rules below. Merge-safe: no prior rules were dropped.)
# =============================================================================

# --- External dependencies (vendored by scripts/fetch-deps.sh) ---------------
# The external/ tree is fetched on demand, never committed. We use
# `external/*` (NOT `external/`) so the negation patterns below can
# re-include the two metadata files — git cannot re-include files under a
# fully-ignored directory, so a bare `external/` would also hide
# external/.gitignore and external/README.md (which ARE tracked).
# See external/README.md and external/.gitignore for the per-dir policy.
external/*
!external/.gitignore
!external/README.md

# --- Build outputs ----------------------------------------------------------
build/
*.o
*.so
*.elf
*.fd
*.apk
*.hap

# --- Editor / IDE cruft -----------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
*.bak

# --- OS cruft ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Python / CMake caches (CI safety net) ----------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
